# design-lint baseline. Counts only go down: `make lint` lowers them.
# Raising one needs `make lint-rebaseline`, DESIGN_LINT_ALLOW_RAISE=1 on push, and a PR note.
version 1
format on
font-size 25
padding-literal 9
spacing-literal 8
radius-literal 9
hex-color 0
raw-color 0
raw-control off AppKit implements the kit controls
file-length 3
try-bang 0
force-cast 0
force-unwrap 1
print 0
opacity-literal 106
frame-literal 25
chamfer-literal 46
motion-literal 5
